OL,3,GNEWSATeacher ban over images with
OL,4,A'revenge porn' hallmarks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teacher at a school for children with
OL,7,Fcomplex needs has been banned from the
OL,8,Fprofession indefinitely for sending
OL,9,Funsolicited images of female genitalia
OL,10,Fand a sex toy to a colleague.
OL,12,FAlastair Grandison, 51, sent the
OL,13,Fpornographic images to a colleague
OL,14,Fwhile employed at St Dominic's School,
OL,15,Fin Godalming, Surrey, in 2022.
OL,17,FThe Teaching Regulation Agency (TRA)
OL,18,Fsaid his behaviour "had the hallmarks
OL,19,Fof revenge pornography".
OL,21,FA spokesperson for St Dominic's said
OL,22,Fthe school did not wish to comment.
